[center][i]— English version below —[/i][/center]

[hr]
[hr]

[center][size=6][b]🎒 Bag Expander[/b][/size]
[i]Configure your inventory from 0 to 10 slots — your game, your rules.[/i][/center]

[hr]

[size=4][b]What it does[/b][/size]

[b]Bag Expander[/b] lets you freely configure the number of inventory slots from [b]0 to 10[/b] (default: 3). Works in singleplayer and multiplayer. No game restart required — just reload the round.

[hr]

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Adjustable slots[/b] — 0 to 10 (default: 3); reload the round to apply
[*][b]Automatic hotkeys[/b] — extra slots 4–10 respond to keys [font=Courier New]4[/font] [font=Courier New]5[/font] [font=Courier New]6[/font] [font=Courier New]7[/font] [font=Courier New]8[/font] [font=Courier New]9[/font] [font=Courier New]0[/font]
[*][b]Host control[/b] — host can cap the maximum slots for everyone in the lobby
[*][b]Leave in base[/b] — extra-slot items can stay at base between rounds instead of returning to the player
[*][b]REPOConfig compatible[/b] — edit all settings in-game without touching any file [i](optional)[/i]
[/list]

[hr]

[size=4][b]Who needs to install it?[/b][/size]

[b]Each player must install the mod individually[/b] to get extra slots on their machine.
The host does [b]not[/b] automatically grant extra slots to clients.

[list]
[*][b]Only the host has the mod[/b] — only the host gets extra slots; clients stay at 3
[*][b]Everyone has the mod[/b] — each player uses their own configured SlotCount
[*][b]Everyone has the mod + HostControls = true[/b] — all slots capped to the host's SlotCount
[*][b]Nobody has the mod[/b] — default game inventory (3 slots)
[/list]

[hr]

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

Edit at [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/com.hiarlyscripter.bagexpander.cfg[/font] or use [b]REPOConfig[/b] in-game.

[b]SlotCount[/b] [i](Section: Slots · default: 3)[/i]
Number of inventory slots, from 0 to 10. Reload the round to apply.

[b]LeaveInBase[/b] [i](Section: Slots · default: false)[/i]
[font=Courier New]true[/font] = extra-slot items stay at base when changing rounds. [font=Courier New]false[/font] = items return equipped to the player.

[b]HostControls[/b] [i](Section: Multiplayer · default: true)[/i]
[font=Courier New]true[/font] = host's SlotCount is the maximum for everyone in the lobby. [font=Courier New]false[/font] = each player uses their own value freely.

[hr]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[size=3][b]Via Vortex (recommended)[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/1218]Vortex Extension for R.E.P.O.[/url] if you haven't already
[*]Click [b]Mod Manager Download[/b] on this page — Vortex installs everything automatically
[*]Deploy mods and launch the game
[/list]

[size=3][b]Manual install[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases]BepInExPack[/url] first
[*]Extract the ZIP — copy [font=Courier New]BepInEx/plugins/HiarlyScripter-BagExpander/[/font] into your game's [font=Courier New]BepInEx/plugins/[/font] folder
[*]Launch the game — the config file is generated automatically at [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/com.hiarlyscripter.bagexpander.cfg[/font]
[*](Optional) Install [b]REPOConfig[/b] to edit settings in-game without opening any file
[/list]

[hr]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]

[b]Required:[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases]BepInEx 5.4.23.5[/url]
[/list]

[b]Optional:[/b]
[list]
[*]REPOConfig — edit settings in-game without opening any files
[/list]

[hr]

[size=4][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]

[b]Extra slots don't appear in the UI[/b]
Reload the round after changing SlotCount.

[b]Clients stuck at 3 slots even with the mod[/b]
Each player must install the mod individually — the host doesn't distribute slots automatically.

[b]Host is limiting my slots[/b]
The host has [font=Courier New]HostControls = true[/font] with a lower SlotCount than yours.

[hr]

